%% SM-05 Enrollment Verification state machine
%% Values: App\Enums\EnrollmentVerificationStatus. Decision recorded by
%% Staff\EnrollmentVerificationController::update.
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> pending : verification record exists for term

    pending --> verified : staff marks enrolled
    pending --> rejected : staff marks not enrolled (reason required)
    pending --> unable_to_verify : staff cannot confirm (reason required)

    verified --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
    unable_to_verify --> [*]

    note right of verified
        Maps profile.enrollment_status to enrolled.
        verified + current academic_year + semester
        satisfies the enrollment.verified middleware.
    end note

    note right of rejected
        Maps profile.enrollment_status to not_enrolled.
        Blocks application submission, document upload,
        booking and service request submission.
    end note

    note left of pending
        GAP-01: no route creates a pending record.
        Records must be inserted out of band until
        an intake screen is delivered.
    end note
